    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2492 = contact with lifting/transmission device, unspecified place, during paid work (SE
        extension of W24). Target SNOMED CT 432534 (269716005, S). W24→432534 crosswalk verified.
        Work-context subsumed by parent. Broader.
        """
}
